## Quick Start

```bash
# Scan a local project
python blame_game.py scan ./my-project --output findings.json

# Scan a remote page
python blame_game.py scan-remote https://example.com --output remote_findings.json

# Inspect the pattern database
python blame_game.py list-patterns
python blame_game.py list-patterns --category financial

# Record a device access
python blame_game.py attest-device \
    --ip 203.0.113.42 \
    --ua "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)" \
    --consent

# Record a file change (append-only)
python blame_game.py log-change \
    --file app.js \
    --type modified \
    --changed-by "j.doe@example.com" \
    --reason "fixed null deref in checkout" \
    --approved-by "review-lead"

# Verify the audit database has no integrity violations
python blame_game.py verify

# Generate the report
python blame_game.py report --output blame_game_report.md
```

