## Command Reference

| Command | Arguments | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `scan` | `path`, `--output` | Recursively analyse a file or directory |
| `scan-remote` | `url`, `--output` | Fetch and analyse a remote page |
| `attest-device` | `--ip`, `--ua`, `--consent` | Record a device access event |
| `log-change` | `--file`, `--type`, `--changed-by`, `--reason`, `--approved-by` | Append a change record |
| `report` | `--output` | Build the markdown accountability report |
| `list-patterns` | `--category` | Print the detection database |
| `verify` | — | Check audit DB integrity |

Valid `--type` values: `created`, `modified`, `deleted`.
Valid `--category` values: `financial`, `deception`, `data_theft`, `obfuscation`, `malware`.

