## Detection Categories

Findings are scored 0–100 and bucketed into four threat levels.

| Level | Score | Meaning | Recommended Action |
|---|---|---|---|
| `low` | 25 | Suspicious, plausibly benign | Review and document rationale |
| `medium` | 50 | Warrants investigation | Request explanation from author |
| `high` | 75 | Likely deceptive | Block deployment, security review |
| `critical` | 100 | Confirmed harmful construct | Remove, preserve evidence |

### Pattern Database (v1.0)

| Pattern | Category | Level | Targets |
|---|---|---|---|
| `stripe_hidden_redirect` | financial | high | Intermediary payment routing (`r.stripe`, `payment.bounce`) |
| `p2p_obfuscated_transfer` | financial | medium | Untraceable-transfer vocabulary |
| `kanata_kantana_api_labs` | deception | high | Implausible third-party API vendors |
| `ad_privacy_deception` | data_theft | high | "Privacy" branding beside collection logic |
| `null_fallback_exploit` | obfuscation | critical | Null-coalesce redirects into parent frames |
| `index_manipulation` | obfuscation | high | Index arithmetic feeding `eval`/`require` |
| `ai_blame_shift` | deception | medium | Comments attributing human decisions to a model |
| `hidden_webhook` | data_theft | high | Undisclosed external callbacks |
| `consent_bypass` | data_theft | critical | Logic that overrides opt-out |
| `obfuscated_endpoint` | obfuscation | high | Base64/`atob`-hidden hosts |
| `data_exfiltration_beacon` | data_theft | high | Silent `sendBeacon`/`fetch` telemetry |
| `dom_overwrite_attack` | obfuscation | medium | Whole-body `innerHTML` replacement |
| `timer_based_evasion` | obfuscation | medium | Delayed execution to defeat static analysis |
| `crypto_miner_hidden` | malware | critical | Covert mining pool startup |
| `keylogger_pattern` | malware | critical | Global keystroke capture |

Adding patterns is straightforward — append a `RedFlagPattern` entry to `RED_FLAG_DATABASE` in `blame_game.py`.

